Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:02.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,This is a Roman warship…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.21,0:00:04.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,and a city wall is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:05.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,picking it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:06.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,Rewind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:07.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,Syracuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:08.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,213 BC.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.17,0:00:09.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,Before dawn,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:11.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,Rome's fleet creeps toward the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.47,0:00:12.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,city walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:13.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,The plan:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.33,0:00:14.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,get so close that the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:16.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,city's catapults…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.26,0:00:18.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,shoot right over their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:19.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,And it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:19.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:20.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,above them…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:21.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,something creaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:23.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,A huge beam swings out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.29,0:00:24.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,over the wall…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:26.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,and lowers an iron hand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:27.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,on a chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.66,0:00:29.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,It grabs the ship by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:29.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,the nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.96,0:00:31.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,Behind the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:32.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,the far end of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:33.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,beam is pushed down,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.73,0:00:34.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,like a seesaw…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:36.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,and the front of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.15,0:00:37.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,ship rises.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.23,0:00:37.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,Higher…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.77,0:00:39.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,until it's standing on its
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.63,0:00:40.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,stern.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.81,0:00:41.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.01,0:00:41.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,they let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:46.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Some ships capsized.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.58,0:00:48.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,Most just filled with water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:50.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,The genius behind it wasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.34,0:00:51.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,a general.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.15,0:00:53.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,He was a mathematician in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.97,0:00:53.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,his seventies:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:54.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,Archimedes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.87,0:00:57.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Roman commander joked that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:00:59.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,Archimedes was using his ships
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.89,0:01:00.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,to scoop up seawater…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.23,0:01:01.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,His men didn't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.41,0:01:03.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,One ancient writer says that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:04.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,whenever a rope or a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:06.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,stick poked over the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:07.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,they screamed…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.34,0:01:08.59,Shout,,0,0,0,,THERE IT IS!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.57,0:01:09.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,…and fled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.27,0:01:14.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Rome stopped attacking the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:15.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,It just waited…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:17.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,because of one old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:09.92,Label,,0,0,0,,SYRACUSE · SICILY · 213 BC
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.74,0:00:37.01,Note,,0,0,0,,RECONSTRUCTION — machine design is our interpretation
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.19,0:01:12.05,Note,,0,0,0,,DRAMATIZATION — the fishing rod is a joke, not history
